{"title": "Blood Bank Log", "pageid": 12770, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Blood_Bank_Log", "categories": ["Books", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Book_Generic_H_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Book_Generic_H_Image.png/300px-Book_Generic_H_Image.png.webp, /w/images/1/1c/Book_Generic_H_Image.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Blood Bank Log image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1c/Book_Generic_H_Image.png/300px-Book_Generic_H_Image.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1c/Book_Generic_H_Image.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Blood Bank Log</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Book\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Book\">book</a> that records the blood and other fluids removed from visitors to the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing\" title=\"House of Healing\">House of Healing</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Crimson fingerprints mar this catalogue of donors to Reithwin's blood bank.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/38px-Books_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/50px-Books_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Books\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/41/Books_Icon.png/25px-Books_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/41/Books_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Books\" title=\"Books\">Books</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/38px-Journal_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/50px-Journal_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Author:  Malus Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp/25px-Journal_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Journal_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Author: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Malus Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\">Malus Thorm</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-b8487df77b1d1b04END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-fb079b113ba98346END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_TWN_BloodBankInventoryList</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_TWN_BloodBankInventoryList\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_TWN_BloodBankInventoryList\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ccf165b7-1cf6-4111-a8a5-54526a50396d</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ccf165b7-1cf6-4111-a8a5-54526a50396d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:ccf165b7-1cf6-4111-a8a5-54526a50396d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In the Morgue Laboratory on a bookshelf, in the back of the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing_Morgue\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"House of Healing Morgue\">House of Healing Morgue</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;5&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-984</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>BLOOD AND BODILY FLUID LOG\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Addendum the First: It is no longer necessary to log names. Race or creature type is sufficient. - MT\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Adendum the Second: You will use either the term 'donor' or 'vessel' when describing a source of extraction. 'Victim' is an ugly and inaccurate word.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Name: [REDACTED]\n</p><p>Race: <a href=\"/wiki/Half-Elf\" title=\"Half-Elf\">Half-Elf</a>\n</p><p>Occupation: Farmer\n</p><p>Cause of Death: Extremity amputation\n</p><p>Extraction Fluid: Blood\n</p><p>Notes: Cadaver dumped in canal\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Name: [REDACTED]\n</p><p>Race: <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>\n</p><p>Occupation: Unknown\n</p><p>Cause of Death: Live extraction\n</p><p>Extraction Fluid: Blood, lymph, spinal fluid\n</p><p>Notes: Refused toll payment. Cadaver cremated after extraction.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Name: UNKNOWN\n</p><p>Race: <a href=\"/wiki/Ogre\" title=\"Ogre\">Ogre</a>\n</p><p>Occupation:\n</p><p>Cause of Death: Fatal wounds to skull and torso\n</p><p>Extraction fluid: Blood\n</p><p>Notes: Corpse confiscated by <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar</a>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>[The list continues for many pages.]\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>\"MT\" is likely <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Malus Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\">Malus Thorm</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202419\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.068 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1868/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 34043/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10542/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936240/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTrans